1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,400
Think about what happens when you open Claude Code on a new task, without any skills configured.

2
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:10,983
The agent has no idea how your team writes PR descriptions, or what your code review checklist looks like, or which files to update when you add an endpoint.

3
00:00:10,983 --> 00:00:12,575
So it guesses.

4
00:00:12,575 --> 00:00:14,583
And then you spend time correcting it.

5
00:00:14,583 --> 00:00:16,116
And the frustrating part?

6
00:00:16,116 --> 00:00:19,675
You correct the same things, in the same ways, every single session.

7
00:00:19,675 --> 00:00:23,025
It's like onboarding a new team member who never learns from past feedback.

